There are various possibilities of connection between MCP server and client

1. Readymade MCP client to Readymade MCP Server , Ex : Claude Desktop and FileSystem Coneector ( access given to Workspace Directory )
2. Readymade MCP client to Custom MCP Local server, Ex : Created local Arithmetic MCP Server and configured in claude_desktop_config.json
3. Readymade MCP client to Custom MCP Remote server
4. Custom MCP client to Readymade MCP Server
5. Custom MCP client to Custom MCP Local Server
6. Custom MCP client to Custom MCP Remote server